    "text": "KRDO\nwebsite\nTrinidad\nSpecial Weather Statement issued September 17 at 6:25PM MDT by NWS Pueblo CO\nBy National Weather Service,\n4 hours agoAt 625 PM MDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near. La Veta, or 34 miles northwest of Trinidad, moving northeast at 5. HAZARD…Wind gusts up to 40 mph and penny size hail. SOURCE…Radar indicated. IMPACT…Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around. unsecured...",
